---
---
<section class="relative min-h-[100dvh] bg-stone-950 flex flex-col">
  <div class="flex-1 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 w-full pt-28 lg:pt-32 gap-10">
    <!-- Left: copy on ink, cinnabar accent -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center">
      <p class="text-brand-500 font-semibold text-xs tracking-[0.22em] uppercase">
        Hubei · 湖北 · The province of a thousand lakes
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.03] text-white max-w-2xl mt-4 pb-1">
        Hubei Province Travel Guide: <span class="text-brand-500">Beyond Wuhan</span>
      </h1>
      <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-brand-500/40 p-4 max-w-xl">
        <p class="text-white text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          <span class="font-bold text-brand-400">The 7-day verdict:</span>
          yes, Hubei is worth it. Fly into Wuhan, then do
          <span class="text-white font-semibold">Wuhan → Wudang → the Three Gorges</span>
          on one high-speed-rail spine.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p class="text-stone-300 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-xl mt-6 leading-relaxed">
        <span class="text-white font-semibold">Central China's easiest yes.</span>
        Seven days, one high-speed rail spine, three world-class sights — Taoist Wudang, the Three Gorges, Shennongjia's forest and Wuhan's hot dry noodles.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-8">
        <a href="#matcher" class="px-6 py-3 bg-brand-700 text-white rounded-full font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-brand-600 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          Pick your direction
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#itineraries" class="px-6 py-3 border border-stone-700 text-white rounded-full font-semibold text-sm hover:border-stone-500 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          See the 7-day route
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 3l5 5-5 5"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 mt-8 text-xs text-stone-400">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Independent guide</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>No sponsorship</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Prices checked quarterly</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Firsthand travel</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Yangtze image framed like a lacquer panel -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative flex items-center">
      <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/3] lg:aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-lg ring-1 ring-brand-800/50">
        <img
          src="/images/hubei-hero.webp"
          alt="The Yangtze River winding through the misty Three Gorges of Hubei Province"
          class="hero-zoom w-full h-full object-cover"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-stone-950/70 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 flex items-end justify-between">
          <p class="text-white/80 text-xs leading-relaxed">The Yangtze at the Three Gorges</p>
          <span class="text-brand-400 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">长江 · 三峡</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Bottom: the three directions strip -->
  <div class="border-t border-stone-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-2 text-sm text-stone-400">
      <span class="font-semibold text-white">From Wuhan, three directions</span>
      <a href="#direction" class="hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>Northwest — Wudang &amp; Shennongjia
      </a>
      <a href="#direction" class="hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>West — Three Gorges
      </a>
      <a href="#direction" class="hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>Southwest — Enshi
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
